"""
The public `std::string` facade.

String access is borrowed and byte-oriented. The facade never exposes the
null-terminated pointer ABI used by the hosted runtime and never allocates a
replacement string. The module is hosted-only until a freestanding target
provides the same checked provider contract.
"""
"""Re-export null, UTF-8, bounds, and provider failures for String access."""
open errors;
"""Re-export allocation-free borrowed byte and length operations."""
open access;
